(card "exp:F-R1-2_vpin_q80_admit" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:F-R1-2_vpin_q80_admit"
  :body "---\nnav: 32\ntype: experiment\nid: F-R1-2_vpin_q80_admit\nshort_name: vpin_q80_admit\ntitle: \"F-R1-2 — anchor default-admit + keep only VPIN@300s trailing-cum q80+\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: f\nround: r1\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_f__microstructure]]\"\ntrain_nav: 1.1480\ntrain_trade_count: 42\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8095\ntrain_sharpe: 7.0311\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0043\nval_nav_mean: 1.0114\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0092\nval_window_count: 10\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: falsified\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 1\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [microstructure, whitelist]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: 10\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/f, round/r1, axis/microstructure, axis/whitelist, status/falsified, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/small]\n---\n\n# F-R1-2 — anchor + keep only VPIN@300s q80+\n\n> **TL;DR** —— F-R1-2 是 F-R1-1 的**反向 hypothesis**：不是 drop 高 VPIN 而是只 keep。train 42 笔/NAV 1.15 << anchor 2.19, count_fail。证明 \"high-VPIN admit\" 这条 microstructure 路线在 anchor pool 上 sample 太稀。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：trailing-cum q80+ 的高 VPIN trade = informed traders 在场 → 这类 trade alpha 更强 → 应只 admit。\n- 反向于 F-R1-1 (drop high OFI)。\n- 实测：whitelist 砍到 42 笔 (anchor 140)，未 strict beat anchor，未上 test。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_f/scripts/round_1_runner.py`\n- 步骤：default-admit base → keep only legs with VPIN@300s ≥ trailing-cum q80; warmup<10 admit.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- trailing-cum quantile strict past-only。`#leak/clean`（F-R1-1 同源 helper, edge-leak fix applied）。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 1.1480 | 42 | 7.03 | 81.0% | -0.43% |\n| Val (rolling 10w only) | 1.0114 ± 0.009 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN (count_fail) | - | - | - | - |\n| **Δ train NAV vs anchor** | **-1.04 (FAIL)** | -98 | -0.67 | -4.7pp | +0.58pp |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 1 (count_fail).\n- mechanism 太严, sample 崩。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **antithesis_of**: [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R1-1__ofi_drop_extreme]] (drop 反, admit 正)\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-1__default_admit_baseline]]\n- **same_team_alt**: [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R2-1__vpin_drop_q80_300s]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_f/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (F-R1-2)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **double falsification**: F-R1-1 (drop q90) 也失败，F-R1-2 (admit q80+) 也失败 → 说明 VPIN/OFI 与 trade 收益**不是 monotone 关系**，整个 microstructure-as-binary-gate axis 在该 arc 不可用。\n- 见 [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R1-1__ofi_drop_extreme]] Notes \"anti-pattern\" 段。\n"
